@flexiarg cascades/edges-earn-permanence
@title Edges Earn Permanence
@sigils [🪙/功]
@keywords cascade, promotion, demand-side, use-receipt, review, declared, derived, bridge, evidence
@audience knowledge-base designers, agent-system builders
@tone design
@factor Discernment (paññā)
@provenance M-apm-demonstration W.70; whitepaper-v3 §6 (demand-side memory); W.24 attach-then-review economy

! conclusion:
  A derived edge becomes a declared edge by the same economy as everything else durable:
  evidence of use, then judged review. Receipt every derived edge that feeds a dispatch;
  edges accumulating use-receipts become promotion candidates for the declared skeleton.

  + context: Declared and derived cascade layers coexist (cascades/declared-skeleton,
    cascades/on-the-fly-cascade) and something must govern movement between them — neither
    editorial fiat (skeleton rots into a wall chart) nor automatic accretion (skeleton bloats
    into noise).

  + IF:
      A derived edge keeps reappearing in used slices across distinct problems and contexts.

  + HOWEVER:
      Use is evidence, not proof: the reviewer must still judge whether the relation
      generalizes beyond the contexts that used it, with power to reject — a rejected candidate
      simply remains derivable. And the reviewer must be a seat that acts as itself
      (reviewer-must-act), not a name passed along.

  + THEN:
      Log slice edges into dispatch receipts (the eligibility-provenance idiom); periodically
      collect edges above a use threshold as a promotion manifest; review with reasons;
      declare the approved edges in the pattern files with their becauses.

  + BECAUSE:
      This is the demand-side principle — kept because used — applied to structure instead of
      content, and it makes the cascade grow exactly as fast as its usefulness is demonstrated.
      The store's first promotion round showed the alternative failure: judged-in-isolation
      attachments produced high per-item fit and zero connective structure.

  + NEXT-STEPS:
    next[Implement the use-receipts FIRST, before any declared edges or derivation engine.]
    next[Run several cycles; if receipts are mostly one-shot noise, this pattern is falsified.]
    next[Promote by manifest and review, never by threshold alone.]
